  "body": "<h1>NBA DFS Rankings for Sunday, November 15 (DraftKings)</h1>\n<p class=\"meta\">DraftKings main slate · <strong>Sunday, November 15</strong> · 5 games · First game 6:00 PM ET · By <strong>Chris Spags</strong> · <!--@@SLATE-PUBLISHED@@--> · Numbers as of <time datetime=\"2026-11-15T16:41:20-05:00\">November 15, 4:41 PM ET</time></p>\n<p>Jalen Johnson (ATL) ranks first on the Sunday, November 15 DraftKings main slate at 51.2 projected DraftKings points for $9,600. Shai Gilgeous-Alexander (OKC, 50.4) and Jayson Tatum (BOS, 49.1) are next.</p>\n<p>The table ranks all 71 players in the run by SPAGS projection, with DraftKings salary and projected points per $1,000.</p>\n<p>Every projection is a SPAGS model estimate from the November 15, 4:41 PM ET run of the Splash Play NBA model. This page updates each time the main-slate numbers are run, and NBA projections move with every injury report, so check the time above before you build.</p>\n<!-- SLOT:OFFER-TOP -->\n<!--@@SLATE-OFFER@@-->\n<style>@media(max-width:480px){.tw.nb th,.tw.nb td{padding-left:5px!important;padding-right:5px!important}.tw.nb th:first-child,.tw.nb td:first-child{padding-left:9px!important}}</style>\n<h2>DraftKings rankings by projection, Nov 15</h2>\n<div class=\"tw nb\"><table><thead><tr><th>#</th><th>Player</th><th>Salary</th><th>SPAGS proj</th><th>Pts/$1K</th><th>Pos</th><th>Team</th></tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr><td>1</td><td><a href=\"/dfs/nba/players/jalen-johnson/\">Jalen Johnson</a></td><td>$9,600</td><td class=\"num\">51.2</td><td class=\"num\">5.33</td><td>PF</td><td>ATL</td></tr>\n<tr><td>2</td><td><a href=\"/dfs/nba/players/shai-gilgeous-alexander/\">Shai Gilgeous-Alexander</a></td><td>$10,600</td><td class=\"num\">50.4</td><td class=\"num\">4.75</td><td>PG</td><td>OKC</td></tr>\n<tr><td>3</td><td><a href=\"/dfs/nba/players/jayson-tatum/\">Jayson Tatum</a></td><td>$10,100</td><td class=\"num\">49.1</td><td class=\"num\">4.86</td><td>SF/PF</td><td>BOS</td></tr>\n<tr><td>4</td><td><a